 style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Interest and debt expense was $141&#160;million&#160;and $133&#160;million&#160;for the second quarters of 2026 and 2025, respectively, and $282 million and $261 million for the first six months of 2026 and 2025, respectively. This is inclusive of amortized discounts, premiums and issuance and other related costs. Capitalized interest was $3&#160;million and $2&#160;million for the second quarters of 2026 and 2025, respectively, and $6&#160;million for the first six months of both 2026 and 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock>
